    - rid: 4351267832094261340
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Why didn't I ask {mc} while I had the chance?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267832094261341
    - rid: 4351267832094261342
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: What are we going to eat out there?!? What if we starve?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Um, Sayori, there will be probably an inn nearby that we could go to-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267832094261343
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, you're right!
