  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I was having trouble paying attention to {mc}, ehehe...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267832094261363
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (So I'm not the only one...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267832094261364
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori, you need to pay attention to {mc} when he speaks.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267832094261365
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
