    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267832094261366
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: He's the only reason that we have any sense of direction at all!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267832094261367
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: The least you could do is give him the respect he deserves.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ... you're right, Yuri...
    ScreenActions:
